abstract: >
  Easy-Code-Lab is an interactive, browser-based learning tool designed to help
  complete beginners build mental models around HTML and CSS. It features hands-on
  exercises, a Tag Builder for learning syntax, and a Box Model Explorer with
  3D visualisation using Three.js. The project aims to make coding accessible to
  students with no prior experience.
